## 2. Go Store Model (struct)

**File:** `/bench/home/work/store/memo.go` -- line 35

```go
type Memo struct {
    ID        int32
    UID       string
    RowStatus RowStatus
    CreatorID int32
    CreatedTs int64
    UpdatedTs int64
    Content    string
    Visibility Visibility
    Pinned     bool
    Payload    *storepb.MemoPayload
    ParentUID *string
}
```

The `Payload` field uses the protobuf-generated `storepb.MemoPayload` type (from `proto/gen/store`). The `Visibility` type is a custom string type defined in the same file (lines 13-22) with constants `Public`, `Protected`, and `Private`. There is also a `FindMemo` struct starting at line 57 that defines query/filter parameters.

